TS9N0g","user":{"login":"PateevK","id":171885206,"node_id":"U_kgDOCj7Clg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171885206?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK","html_url":"https://github.com/PateevK","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-08T18:28:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T18:28:05Z","body":"> [#123142](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123142) might solve this issue.\n\nunfortunately that didnt help (╥﹏╥)\n\naccording to my investigation thats an intel dx12 driver bug caused by simply using `D3D12_PRIMITIVE_TOPOLOGY_TYPE_LINE` for grid gizmos and looking at the grid at certain angles. I guess it somehow breaks rasterizer cause as PIX has shown rasterizer input is available but no rasterizer output is produced, GPU is 100% busy for the whole frame duration except the very end where it gets unstuck.\n\nI've made a simple project where there is just `clear` and `draw_grid` functions + basic DX12 init. And get the same result.\n\nUsing compute based approach for grid rendering should help but that would be weird as an intel driver workaround ⋆˚꩜｡ּ\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5589913042/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]